OL,3,GNEWSAE-motorbike killer's jail sentence
OL,4,Aincreased
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who knocked down and killed an
OL,7,F86-year-old grandmother while on an
OL,8,Fillegal e-motorbike has had his jail
OL,9,Fterm increased by almost two years
OL,10,Fafter the initial sentence was ruled
OL,11,Funduly lenient.
OL,13,FBilly Stokoe had taken cannabis and was
OL,14,Fusing a mobile phone when he hit Gloria
OL,15,FStephenson on a zebra crossing in
OL,16,FSunderland last year and then rode off,
OL,17,Fleaving her dying at the scene.
OL,19,FIn May this year, Stokoe, then 19, was
OL,20,Fgiven a sentence of six years and nine
OL,21,Fmonths after admitting causing death by
OL,22,Fdangerous driving.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
